 #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531111} :answer-field/id #uuid "a5d80446-5433-569c-ad43-d2633b905967" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531500}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "eadcb6eb-28e0-561c-baf8-c3576858d2b7" :question/math-academy-id "q-332585" :question/problem "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=-3{x}_{1}(t)+2{x}_{2}(t)+5\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+7\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=4{x}_{1}(t)-{x}_{2}(t)+3\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe systems of linear ODEs above can be written in matrix form as follows:\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"30px\" rowspan=\"2\">${x}^{′}(t)=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"40px\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,\\,x(t)+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-3}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+\\,\\,$</td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-4}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"40px\" rowspan=\"2\">$\\,\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-5}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"30px\">{{field-6}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-7}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n<td height=\"30px\" width=\"5px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-8}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>" :question/worked-solution "First, let's rewrite our system, highlighting the coefficients:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=(-3)\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+2\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+5\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+7\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)=4\\cdot {x}_{1}(t)+(-1)\\cdot {x}_{2}(t)+3\\cdot \\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+(-2)\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in matrix form:\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 2 \\\\ 4 & -1\\end{aligned}]x(t)+[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\operatorname{sin}⁡(4t)+[\\begin{aligned}7 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]\\operatorname{cos}⁡(t)\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}(t)\\end{aligned}].$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186531590 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166902 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "51834713-edc2-5af3-a0dc-fb54ea4040c6" :knowledge-point/title "Writing Down an Inhomogeneous System of Linear ODEs in Matrix Form"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "231f5d7d-ba14-58c8-9817-e96238be05d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530940}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "231f5d7d-ba14-58c8-9817-e96238be05d4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186530940} :answer-field/id #uuid "0975e181-89ef-5188-9ed5-faa802b35aa0" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531390} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e07e33b3-ea76-5f2d-8458-b5bf6baa03bd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186531322}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/